Drawably for SwiftUI
====================

This package is a native SwiftUI port of Drawably, a hand-drawn UI control
library for the web.

    Drawably — https://www.drawably.dev
    https://github.com/Danilaa1/drawably
    Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Belyi
    Licensed under the MIT License

The stroke-generation engine (Sources/Drawably/Core) is a direct port of
Drawably's `src/prng.ts` and `src/rough.ts`, and the component geometry in
Sources/Drawably/Components follows `src/controls.ts`. Test fixtures under
Tests/DrawablyTests/Fixtures are generated from the published npm package so
this port can be verified against upstream output.
